    "description": "Product Description\nUp for auction is a stunning, finely crafted vintage ethnic tribal bangle bracelet (Kada) made from solid 925 sterling silver. This substantial piece features a beautiful twisted, fluted design with intricate wire-wrap detailing near the terminals. It is equipped with a traditional, fully functional handcrafted screw/pin closure mechanism that secures the piece seamlessly.\nThe bracelet exhibits a gorgeous, authentic deep patina in its recessed details, perfectly accentuating its textured workmanship. This is a remarkable addition for collectors of ethnic, southwestern, or global artisan jewelry.\nItem Specifics\nMetal: Sterling Silver\nPurity: 925 (Stamped)\nStyle: Bangle, Tribal, Ethnic, Kada\nDesign: Twisted/Fluted rope motif with ornate accents\nClosure: Traditional threaded screw-pin lock\nCondition: Excellent vintage condition with natural oxidation/tarnish. The closure operates smoothly.",
